Backport RDP Unicode input to xrdp 0.10.6.1.

Upstream Apache-2.0 sources:
- https://github.com/neutrinolabs/xrdp/pull/3058
  merge 98d0003715be1e0693817f49925d48b558df69bb
- https://github.com/neutrinolabs/xrdp/pull/3090
  merge 5c4278ccb16c5cce7134face70b13c061217537e

Base: xrdp-0.10.6.1.tar.gz, SHA-256
2f7beb5a3b2529c8d72dc0df9b8cdca31ab0e0c14d1e3421210f5e6ec0ab3b75

Adaptation: omit upstream CI edits, refresh Autotools context, append Unicode
state after existing vmconnect field to preserve existing field offsets.
Local lifecycle adaptation: retain one bus/factory/main loop per chansrv session;
restore an owned previous engine name on viewer disconnect, guard engine
references, and wait with bounds for factory/engine readiness. Fail chansrv
explicitly on bus loss. Do not log committed Unicode code points.
Regenerate Autotools files with autoreconf -fi before configuring --enable-ibus.

